# Build output.
#
# `dist/` holds the cross-compiled binaries the release workflow uploads. A
# stale binary checked out alongside a freshly built one would be published
# too, so it never belongs in the repository.
dist/
weedout
weedout.exe

# Go
*.test
*.out
coverage.txt

# A developer's own project config. It holds an API key by design — the point
# of the warning the CLI prints when it writes one.
.weedout

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
